WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.142 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:43.844 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional song playing]

00:00:58.359 --> 00:00:59.485 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:01:39.817 --> 00:01:42.611 line:80%
But why would you say liking me

00:01:43.654 --> 00:01:45.322 line:80%
is being greedy?

00:01:45.906 --> 00:01:47.408 line:80%
Because you'll go back soon?

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.244 line:80%
It doesn't matter if I'm being greedy now.

00:01:52.705 --> 00:01:54.373 line:80%
I can't stop my feelings anyway.

00:01:57.418 --> 00:01:58.961 line:80%
So I'll just keep going,

00:01:59.044 --> 00:02:01.588 line:80%
because I don't want
to waste our time together.

00:02:04.425 --> 00:02:07.428 line:80%
Then don't say
you're being greedy anymore.

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:09.263 line:80%
If you say that again,

00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.598 line:80%
I won't let it slide.

00:02:13.058 --> 00:02:14.435 line:80%
I should be careful, then.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.103 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:02:18.188 --> 00:02:19.189 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:02:19.273 --> 00:02:21.066 line:20%
EPISODE 8

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:24.778 line:20%
Stop staring at it.

00:02:24.862 --> 00:02:26.655 line:20%
It won't even be visible tomorrow.

00:02:28.073 --> 00:02:30.784 line:20%
Oh. And make sure to call your grandma.

00:02:30.868 --> 00:02:33.245 line:20%
She'll be worried sick
after you left like that.

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:36.415 line:20%
[inhales sharply] I will.

00:02:39.460 --> 00:02:41.337 line:20%
I used to be just like that watch.

00:02:42.796 --> 00:02:46.800 line:20%
I was frozen in time,
but someone made time move again for me.

00:02:47.426 --> 00:02:48.510 line:20%
Like this.

00:02:54.058 --> 00:02:58.604 line:80%
So how about letting time with your dad
start moving again?

00:03:03.233 --> 00:03:04.902 line:80%
The past is the past.

00:03:05.444 --> 00:03:06.487 line:80%
What's important

00:03:07.571 --> 00:03:09.281 line:80%
is the time that will flow from now on.

00:03:19.875 --> 00:03:22.127 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:03:32.096 --> 00:03:34.306 line:80%
[Nana] <i>Her boyfriend died back then.</i>

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.393 line:80%
<i>He went to study in Boston,</i>
<i>but he suddenly died.</i>

00:03:37.476 --> 00:03:38.602 line:80%
Hey, roomie.

00:03:38.686 --> 00:03:42.606 line:80%
[Chan] <i>The fact that I lived</i>
<i>while he died from that accident…</i>

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:45.025 line:80%
<i>It's a good thing you took it out.</i>

00:03:45.901 --> 00:03:49.238 line:80%
<i>I want someone to have joy in their life.</i>

00:03:49.321 --> 00:03:52.866 line:80%
<i>She was a grateful disruption</i>
<i>that made me live again.</i>

00:03:56.704 --> 00:03:58.330 line:80%
Mr. Park, we…

00:03:59.081 --> 00:04:01.166 line:80%
Of course. I know.

00:04:09.591 --> 00:04:11.135 line:80%
Take her home safely.

00:04:12.678 --> 00:04:14.805 line:80%
Let's go, Genius.

00:04:35.743 --> 00:04:36.744 line:80%
Go on in.

00:04:39.621 --> 00:04:40.748 line:80%
Bye.

00:04:40.831 --> 00:04:41.832 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:45.336 line:80%
[Haran stutters] Look forward.

00:04:45.419 --> 00:04:47.421 line:80%
It'll be dangerous
if you fall down the hill.

00:04:47.504 --> 00:04:49.465 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music continues]

00:04:53.344 --> 00:04:54.887 line:80%
[sighs] I'm relieved.

00:04:56.055 --> 00:04:57.056 line:80%
You're warm.

00:04:57.931 --> 00:04:59.350 line:80%
It's just that…

00:05:00.476 --> 00:05:01.685 line:80%
this feels like a dream.

00:05:03.187 --> 00:05:04.605 line:80%
I can't believe it.

00:05:13.906 --> 00:05:15.491 line:80%
-Should I make this feel more real?
-[grunts]

00:05:15.574 --> 00:05:16.867 line:80%
No, thanks.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:17.951 line:80%
[both laugh]

00:05:18.702 --> 00:05:20.537 line:80%
[sighs] I'll go now. Head inside.

00:05:21.121 --> 00:05:22.164 line:80%
Get back safely.

00:05:39.223 --> 00:05:40.224 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:05:40.307 --> 00:05:41.350 line:80%
What a relief.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:46.021 line:80%
[grunts]

00:05:47.356 --> 00:05:48.357 line:80%
[groans]

00:05:49.024 --> 00:05:50.484 line:80%
-[groans softly]
-[door opens]

00:05:50.567 --> 00:05:52.987 line:80%
[Chan] Now, now.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.280 line:80%
You didn't take your meds again? [grunts]

00:05:56.865 --> 00:05:59.785 line:80%
-I told you to take them on time.
-[sighs]

00:05:59.868 --> 00:06:02.413 line:80%
Let's go to the hospital this week.

00:06:02.496 --> 00:06:06.083 line:80%
Keep your cardiac enzyme
test results in your wallet

00:06:06.959 --> 00:06:10.504 line:80%
so someone can see it if you ever collapse
when you're not with me.

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.131 line:80%
We have to go, okay?

00:06:12.756 --> 00:06:16.010 line:80%
Just think of me as a nagging son,

00:06:16.093 --> 00:06:18.178 line:80%
and come with me.

00:06:19.096 --> 00:06:20.347 line:80%
All right.

00:06:20.431 --> 00:06:21.557 line:80%
And you

00:06:22.224 --> 00:06:24.935 line:80%
should think of me
as a father who listens to you,

00:06:25.561 --> 00:06:27.396 line:80%
so tell me anything

00:06:28.355 --> 00:06:30.649 line:80%
that you have a hard time
telling anyone else.

00:06:30.733 --> 00:06:32.860 line:80%
You can tell me
anything that troubles you.

00:06:34.611 --> 00:06:36.530 line:80%
I'll be your safe space.

00:06:39.408 --> 00:06:42.328 line:80%
I wasn't trying to hide
my relationship with Ms. Song…

00:06:42.411 --> 00:06:43.829 line:80%
You really like her, right?

00:06:44.705 --> 00:06:45.873 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:06:45.956 --> 00:06:48.250 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:06:48.334 --> 00:06:49.960 line:80%
-Yes.
-All right.

00:06:50.794 --> 00:06:55.132 line:80%
Let her feel joy again.

00:06:55.215 --> 00:07:00.012 line:80%
You don't need a reason
to want someone to be happy.

00:07:00.095 --> 00:07:03.474 line:80%
As long as you're sincere, it's okay.

00:07:10.731 --> 00:07:12.775 line:80%
[deliveryman] Ms. Song,
there's an international delivery.

00:07:18.781 --> 00:07:19.782 line:80%
[Haran] Wow.

00:07:21.825 --> 00:07:24.161 line:80%
<i>I finally got the sketch sample</i>
<i>for my design.</i>

00:07:24.244 --> 00:07:25.496 line:80%
<i>Make some noise!</i>

00:07:28.082 --> 00:07:29.667 line:80%
<i>It's all thanks to this pen.</i>

00:07:40.719 --> 00:07:43.597 line:80%
<i>But how did you come up</i>
<i>with the idea of sending me a pen?</i>

00:07:46.642 --> 00:07:50.062 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I kept thinking about how you said</i>
<i>you felt like you were trapped.</i>

00:07:53.357 --> 00:07:54.900 line:80%
<i>I used to feel that way, too.</i>

00:07:56.068 --> 00:07:59.279 line:80%
<i>Back then, I kept thinking the same thing.</i>

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:06.203 line:80%
<i>If…</i>

00:08:06.870 --> 00:08:09.707 line:80%
<i>there was just a small crack</i>
<i>to breathe through, I could live.</i>

00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:12.376 line:80%
<i>But…</i>

00:08:12.876 --> 00:08:15.879 line:80%
<i>that "if" never came true for me.</i>

00:08:17.256 --> 00:08:19.049 line:80%
<i>I guess I wanted</i>

00:08:19.133 --> 00:08:21.301 line:80%
<i>that pen to be that "if" for you.</i>

00:08:22.052 --> 00:08:23.053 line:80%
[sighs]

00:08:23.846 --> 00:08:26.265 line:80%
Chan understands me so well…

00:08:28.142 --> 00:08:30.477 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Sorry, I was rambling.</i>

00:08:31.687 --> 00:08:32.896 line:80%
<i>I should go now.</i>

00:08:42.281 --> 00:08:43.282 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:08:43.866 --> 00:08:45.659 line:80%
-[Ben] Great work today.
-[Chan] You too.

00:08:46.744 --> 00:08:49.038 line:80%
-I'm going back to Korea first.
-Okay, sure.

00:08:49.121 --> 00:08:50.122 line:80%
[Ben chuckles]

00:08:51.582 --> 00:08:53.751 line:80%
[chuckles, inhales sharply]

00:08:55.294 --> 00:08:56.337 line:80%
[sighs]

00:08:59.048 --> 00:09:02.176 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Maybe it's because I lost</i>
<i>the pen I used for seven years,</i>

00:09:02.259 --> 00:09:04.887 line:80%
<i>but I couldn't sketch anything</i>
<i>during the two days here.</i>

00:09:05.846 --> 00:09:08.515 line:20%
[Chan in English]
Yes, seven years ago. Early July.

00:09:08.599 --> 00:09:10.768 line:80%
And the engraving is Haran.

00:09:10.851 --> 00:09:12.061 line:80%
[shop owner] <i>One second.</i>

00:09:12.144 --> 00:09:16.315 line:80%
<i>Uh, yeah. We have the model name</i>
<i>and the engraving design on file.</i>

00:09:19.943 --> 00:09:21.153 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:09:21.236 --> 00:09:22.279 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.745 line:80%
[in Korean] The past is the past.

00:09:30.829 --> 00:09:32.206 line:80%
What's important…

00:09:38.003 --> 00:09:39.963 line:80%
[Chan and Haran] <i>is the time</i>
<i>that will flow from now on.</i>

00:09:41.006 --> 00:09:42.675 line:80%
[wind whooshing]

00:09:42.758 --> 00:09:45.928 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[birds chirping]

00:09:46.011 --> 00:09:47.930 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:09:50.349 --> 00:09:51.433 line:80%
[Hayeong] Grandma.

00:09:51.517 --> 00:09:52.685 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:09:52.768 --> 00:09:54.770 line:80%
Where have you been?

00:09:54.853 --> 00:09:56.522 line:80%
I was at a meeting.

00:09:56.605 --> 00:09:57.982 line:80%
Our dinner ended late.

00:09:58.065 --> 00:09:59.692 line:80%
A meeting dressed like this?

00:10:00.526 --> 00:10:01.944 line:80%
And what's this…

00:10:02.027 --> 00:10:03.070 line:80%
I'll do it.

00:10:03.612 --> 00:10:05.322 line:80%
I'm tired. I'm going to bed.

00:10:06.699 --> 00:10:08.200 line:80%
Grandma, did you go to Seongsu…

00:10:08.283 --> 00:10:10.619 line:80%
I'm sorry, but just let this go for now.

00:10:10.703 --> 00:10:11.829 line:80%
Please.

00:10:13.622 --> 00:10:14.665 line:80%
What?

00:10:15.708 --> 00:10:16.917 line:80%
I just…

00:10:17.001 --> 00:10:20.504 line:80%
thought we haven't been
talking much lately.

00:10:20.587 --> 00:10:22.965 line:80%
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:26.385 line:80%
What's wrong is you asking questions
when I'm so sleepy.

00:10:26.468 --> 00:10:28.012 line:80%
-[chuckles]
-Go to bed.

00:10:28.679 --> 00:10:30.931 line:80%
All right. Good night.

00:10:35.936 --> 00:10:37.229 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:10:37.313 --> 00:10:38.731 line:80%
Why are her shoes like that?

00:10:40.691 --> 00:10:42.234 line:80%
It couldn't have been a meeting.

00:10:44.862 --> 00:10:46.363 line:80%
Where in the world was she?

00:10:46.989 --> 00:10:48.073 line:80%
[sighs wearily]

00:10:59.126 --> 00:11:02.212 line:20%
EXAMINATION

00:11:21.523 --> 00:11:22.524 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:11:22.608 --> 00:11:24.068 line:20%
[automation] <i>The door is closing.</i>

00:11:24.818 --> 00:11:26.737 line:20%
[exclaims] Let me get on!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:28.238 line:80%
Thank you.

00:11:28.322 --> 00:11:31.200 line:80%
[Hayeong panting]

00:11:31.283 --> 00:11:32.910 line:80%
-[exclaims softly]
-[clears throat]

00:11:39.041 --> 00:11:40.167 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>What's that?</i>

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.087 line:80%
<i>He's the definition of neatness,</i>
<i>and he's got bedhead?</i>

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.506 line:80%
[in English] Okay,
I'll check and email you.

00:11:47.174 --> 00:11:49.885 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:11:52.596 --> 00:11:55.474 line:80%
[in Korean]
He's late and has bedhead? Mr. Yeon?

00:11:56.642 --> 00:11:59.103 line:80%
What's going on?
That doesn't suit him at all.

00:11:59.186 --> 00:12:00.187 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:12:00.270 --> 00:12:01.814 line:80%
-Look. Isn't it crazy?
-[Sol and Raemee exclaim]

00:12:01.897 --> 00:12:03.482 line:80%
-This is insane.
-Is this for real?

00:12:03.565 --> 00:12:05.025 line:80%
Sorry! What are you up to?

00:12:05.109 --> 00:12:07.778 line:80%
Hayeong! Seunggyu took a rare photo.

00:12:07.861 --> 00:12:09.154 line:80%
What photo?

00:12:09.238 --> 00:12:12.157 line:80%
[Seunggyu] I was organizing the photos
I took during my trend research…

00:12:12.241 --> 00:12:14.201 line:80%
[exclaims] and I was shocked.

00:12:14.284 --> 00:12:16.578 line:80%
That stiff, uptight Mr. Yeon is dating?

00:12:17.287 --> 00:12:20.749 line:80%
-This is crazy!
-[Sol and Raemee giggle]

00:12:20.833 --> 00:12:23.377 line:80%
[Sol exclaims delightedly]
But they look so good together.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.461 line:80%
[Raemee] They do.

00:12:24.545 --> 00:12:26.380 line:80%
-[♪ amusing music playing]
-[folders thud loudly]

00:12:26.463 --> 00:12:27.548 line:80%
How shameless.

00:12:28.257 --> 00:12:30.134 line:80%
Why is she being so loud when she's late?

00:12:30.217 --> 00:12:32.428 line:80%
Hey, look.

00:12:35.723 --> 00:12:37.474 line:80%
She's the head of La Mode Eclat,

00:12:38.058 --> 00:12:40.686 line:80%
-and that's the co-head and her husband.
-[♪ music ends]

00:12:40.769 --> 00:12:42.896 line:80%
-[Sol groans]
-[Raemee] Oh, geez.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.607 line:80%
Seunggyu! They were just having
a business meeting.

00:12:45.691 --> 00:12:49.236 line:80%
[sighs] So they were the heads
of La Mode Eclat.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.280 line:80%
[Seunggyu laughs]

00:12:51.363 --> 00:12:53.949 line:80%
-Sorry about that.
-[whistling]

00:12:56.076 --> 00:12:58.287 line:80%
Oh, dear. Why is she suddenly whistling?

00:12:58.370 --> 00:12:59.913 line:80%
There's no in-between with her.

00:12:59.997 --> 00:13:01.165 line:80%
-[Sol chuckles softly]
-[stops whistling]

00:13:01.665 --> 00:13:02.666 line:80%
He's right.

00:13:03.334 --> 00:13:04.626 line:80%
Why am I relieved?

00:13:05.586 --> 00:13:06.795 line:80%
[Seunggyu] But I wonder if Mr. Yeon

00:13:06.879 --> 00:13:09.423 line:80%
would still have that default expression
when he's dating.

00:13:09.506 --> 00:13:11.800 line:80%
[Sol] No way. I'm sure he'll be different.

00:13:11.884 --> 00:13:16.597 line:80%
[inhales sharply] He might be
really sweet to the woman he likes.

00:13:17.181 --> 00:13:19.141 line:80%
[in English] Sweet?

00:13:19.224 --> 00:13:21.226 line:80%
[♪ enchanting music playing]

00:13:27.316 --> 00:13:28.317 line:80%
[in Korean] Your hand.

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:30.361 line:80%
[Taeseok] You might slip
since you're wearing heels.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:37.117 line:80%
-[♪ enchanting music continuing]
-This happened to my friend,

00:13:37.201 --> 00:13:38.285 line:80%
uh…

00:13:38.369 --> 00:13:40.621 line:80%
but this guy

00:13:40.704 --> 00:13:44.792 line:80%
brushed off dry leaves in the dirt
with his bare hands so she wouldn't slip.

00:13:44.875 --> 00:13:46.502 line:80%
What does that mean?

00:13:46.585 --> 00:13:47.753 line:80%
With his bare hands?

00:13:48.337 --> 00:13:49.338 line:80%
That's love.

00:13:49.421 --> 00:13:50.589 line:80%
[stutters] Love?

00:13:51.507 --> 00:13:54.718 line:80%
Then if the woman cried,

00:13:54.802 --> 00:13:58.055 line:80%
and he looked at her with pity
and wiped her tears with his hand,

00:13:58.138 --> 00:13:59.932 line:80%
what does that mean?

00:14:00.015 --> 00:14:01.642 line:80%
[exclaims softly]

00:14:01.725 --> 00:14:02.726 line:80%
[softly] Love.

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.645 line:80%
-[Hayeong gasps] <i>He loves me?</i>
-[♪ amusing music playing]

00:14:04.728 --> 00:14:07.356 line:80%
And the fact that
you're overanalyzing his every move

00:14:07.439 --> 00:14:09.316 line:80%
means you like him too.

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.360 line:80%
-[all exclaim teasingly]
-No, that wasn't about me.

00:14:11.443 --> 00:14:12.653 line:80%
That was my friend.

00:14:12.736 --> 00:14:14.113 line:80%
-It's obvious it was about you.
-[laughs]

00:14:14.196 --> 00:14:16.865 line:80%
My friend told me during a school reunion.

00:14:16.949 --> 00:14:17.950 line:80%
[Sol] You liar.

00:14:18.033 --> 00:14:19.076 line:80%
Ms. Song Hayeong.

00:14:20.869 --> 00:14:22.788 line:80%
-The new material you mentioned…
-[Hayeong] Ah.

00:14:22.871 --> 00:14:24.957 line:80%
Uh… Mmm…

00:14:28.335 --> 00:14:29.586 line:80%
Hello?

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:31.255 line:80%
Yes, hello.

00:14:31.338 --> 00:14:33.799 line:80%
-I just got an urgent call.
-[♪ music ends]

00:14:33.882 --> 00:14:35.342 line:80%
Are you busy right now?

00:14:35.426 --> 00:14:36.427 line:80%
I'm busy too.

00:14:37.094 --> 00:14:39.054 line:80%
[birds chirping]

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.768 line:80%
What should I say when I give this to her?

00:14:53.193 --> 00:14:54.278 line:80%
Hmm? [chuckles softly]

00:14:58.574 --> 00:15:01.035 line:80%
Hey, you said
you're coming in the evening.

00:15:01.702 --> 00:15:02.995 line:80%
I'm meeting someone here.

00:15:03.078 --> 00:15:04.621 line:80%
Goodness.

00:15:04.705 --> 00:15:05.914 line:80%
You mean with me?

00:15:05.998 --> 00:15:07.458 line:80%
[footsteps approaching rapidly]

00:15:07.541 --> 00:15:09.043 line:80%
-She's meeting me!
-[Chan groans]

00:15:09.126 --> 00:15:12.296 line:80%
-Hmm?
-What? This is so sudden.

00:15:12.379 --> 00:15:14.798 line:80%
Something came up,
so she's returning to Mungyeong today.

00:15:14.882 --> 00:15:17.301 line:80%
Wow. You were going to meet without me?

00:15:17.801 --> 00:15:19.636 line:80%
-You're always leaving me out.
-[Chan's grandma] Right.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:21.680 line:80%
[Chan sighs, mumbles playfully]

00:15:21.764 --> 00:15:23.432 line:80%
-He's sulking.
-[chuckles]

00:15:23.515 --> 00:15:24.975 line:80%
This place looks nice.

00:15:30.356 --> 00:15:31.565 line:80%
Wow.

00:15:32.274 --> 00:15:34.985 line:80%
It's shattered and cracked.

00:15:36.403 --> 00:15:38.989 line:80%
And there seem to be
some pieces missing. Hmm?

00:15:40.574 --> 00:15:41.575 line:80%
Will it be too hard?

00:15:46.205 --> 00:15:47.206 line:80%
[sighs dejectedly]

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.833 line:80%
I can make it work.

00:15:49.917 --> 00:15:51.835 line:80%
-[♪ lighthearted music playing]
-[exclaims]

00:15:51.919 --> 00:15:53.212 line:80%
It may take some time,

00:15:53.295 --> 00:15:56.632 line:80%
but as long as we don't give up,
it can be fixed somehow.

00:15:56.715 --> 00:15:57.966 line:80%
[sighs in relief]

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.010 line:80%
[Chan's grandma]
It would be different from the original,

00:16:00.094 --> 00:16:02.388 line:80%
but let's think of it
as making it stronger.

00:16:02.471 --> 00:16:04.348 line:80%
Thank you so much.

00:16:04.431 --> 00:16:06.308 line:80%
Here's your coffee.

00:16:06.392 --> 00:16:07.810 line:80%
[Chan's grandma chuckles]

00:16:07.893 --> 00:16:10.854 line:80%
My grandson must be troubling you a lot.

00:16:11.563 --> 00:16:14.358 line:80%
If he does anything to irritate you,

00:16:14.441 --> 00:16:17.861 line:80%
you can just smack him on the back
and kick him out.

00:16:17.945 --> 00:16:19.321 line:80%
Really?

00:16:19.405 --> 00:16:23.158 line:80%
He's been nagging me so much lately
that I've been thinking about it.

00:16:23.867 --> 00:16:26.120 line:80%
I will keep that in mind.

00:16:26.203 --> 00:16:27.287 line:80%
[all laugh]

00:16:27.371 --> 00:16:29.498 line:80%
-Stop it.
-[Chan clears throat]

00:16:29.581 --> 00:16:33.210 line:80%
You must be curious about the house.
You can take a look after you're done.

00:16:33.293 --> 00:16:36.547 line:80%
No, it's your private space. I shouldn't…

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.882 line:80%
It's fine. It's also Chan's house.

00:16:38.966 --> 00:16:40.175 line:80%
Give her a tour later.

00:16:41.427 --> 00:16:46.265 line:80%
Seeing you stay with someone so nice
makes me feel at ease.

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.225 line:80%
[Chan's grandma chuckles]

00:16:48.309 --> 00:16:50.227 line:80%
Be good to him, all right?

00:16:50.311 --> 00:16:51.353 line:80%
I will.

00:16:52.021 --> 00:16:53.022 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:16:53.105 --> 00:16:55.733 line:80%
Wow. [chuckling]

00:16:56.442 --> 00:16:57.526 line:80%
[gasps]

00:17:03.449 --> 00:17:07.077 line:80%
So how about letting time with your dad
start moving again?

00:17:13.167 --> 00:17:14.168 line:80%
Chan.

00:17:16.587 --> 00:17:18.130 line:80%
[stutters] It's nothing. Never mind.

00:17:18.881 --> 00:17:21.717 line:80%
[in singsong] It was nothing. [chuckles]

00:17:25.095 --> 00:17:27.139 line:80%
-When will you visit again?
-[both chuckle]

00:17:28.015 --> 00:17:30.059 line:80%
That little brat isn't even seeing me off.

00:17:30.142 --> 00:17:31.226 line:80%
I should give him a smack.

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.519 line:80%
[Chan] Grandma.

00:17:33.395 --> 00:17:34.938 line:80%
Can you drop me off on the way?

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.524 line:80%
Where?

00:17:38.108 --> 00:17:39.109 line:80%
Daejeon.

00:17:39.193 --> 00:17:41.445 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:17:42.613 --> 00:17:44.657 line:80%
I don't know what I'll do there,

00:17:45.407 --> 00:17:47.785 line:80%
but I think
I should at least give this back to him.

00:17:49.745 --> 00:17:50.746 line:80%
[Chan] Mm.

00:17:52.539 --> 00:17:53.749 line:80%
[chuckling]

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:59.046 line:80%
[Chan's grandma exclaims softly]

00:17:59.129 --> 00:18:00.130 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:18:02.341 --> 00:18:03.926 line:80%
[Hadam's friend]
<i>I saw Yougyum this weekend.</i>

00:18:04.009 --> 00:18:06.136 line:80%
<i>He was going to karaoke with his friends.</i>

00:18:10.182 --> 00:18:11.892 line:80%
[Hadam] Are you having
a lot of fun these days?

00:18:12.393 --> 00:18:14.186 line:80%
Did you have fun at karaoke?

00:18:15.729 --> 00:18:17.481 line:80%
What? I…

00:18:17.564 --> 00:18:19.566 line:80%
[♪ amusing music playing]

00:18:22.403 --> 00:18:24.405 line:80%
Yeah, I had fun.

00:18:25.072 --> 00:18:26.949 line:80%
You seemed to be having fun, too.

00:18:27.783 --> 00:18:30.369 line:80%
You gave Seokhyeon
a drink with a heart on it.

00:18:31.078 --> 00:18:32.079 line:80%
What?

00:18:32.162 --> 00:18:33.288 line:80%
[sighs]

00:18:33.372 --> 00:18:34.373 line:80%
So you saw it.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.166 line:80%
Yeah, I'm happy these days.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.210 line:80%
I'm really glad to hear that.

00:18:38.293 --> 00:18:40.796 line:80%
Yeah, so let's both live happy lives.

00:18:46.552 --> 00:18:47.553 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:18:47.636 --> 00:18:50.389 line:80%
CHEMICAL AND BIOLOGICAL ENGINEERING
PROFESSOR SUNWOO SEOK

00:19:00.816 --> 00:19:02.026 line:80%
[sighs]

00:19:07.865 --> 00:19:08.907 line:80%
May I help you?

00:19:10.326 --> 00:19:12.828 line:80%
Oh. I'm here to see Professor Sunwoo.

00:19:12.911 --> 00:19:14.246 line:80%
[assistant] Ah.

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:15.914 line:80%
He's gone to the president's office.

00:19:15.998 --> 00:19:18.500 line:80%
-May I ask what you're here for?
-[hesitates]

00:19:20.919 --> 00:19:22.254 line:80%
We're family.

00:19:23.213 --> 00:19:25.507 line:80%
-If he's not here--
-He'll probably be back soon.

00:19:25.924 --> 00:19:27.134 line:80%
Why don't you wait inside?

00:19:27.426 --> 00:19:28.844 line:80%
Ah…

00:19:28.927 --> 00:19:30.554 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:19:30.637 --> 00:19:32.640 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:19:48.572 --> 00:19:50.282 line:80%
-[knocks on door]
-[door opens]

00:19:50.366 --> 00:19:52.284 line:80%
He's taking a while.

00:19:52.368 --> 00:19:53.535 line:80%
Should I try calling him?

00:19:54.995 --> 00:19:57.039 line:80%
No, I'll just go.

00:19:57.706 --> 00:20:01.377 line:80%
[hesitates] Would it be okay
to leave this here?

00:20:01.919 --> 00:20:03.045 line:80%
Sure, go ahead.

00:20:05.255 --> 00:20:06.256 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:20:08.759 --> 00:20:09.760 line:80%
[door closes]

00:20:13.514 --> 00:20:16.392 line:80%
KOREA SCIENCE UNIVERSITY

00:20:19.144 --> 00:20:20.896 line:80%
Let me keep this, Dad.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:22.648 line:80%
-[young Chan gasps]
-[door slams]

00:20:22.731 --> 00:20:25.234 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:20:49.258 --> 00:20:50.926 line:80%
How long are you going to keep doing this?

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.679 line:80%
What more do I have to do
to make you stop?

00:21:22.249 --> 00:21:23.584 line:80%
[sighs heavily]

00:21:26.003 --> 00:21:27.004 line:80%
[sniffles]

00:21:37.598 --> 00:21:38.599 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:21:38.682 --> 00:21:40.267 line:80%
Excuse me, you said you're family.

00:21:40.851 --> 00:21:44.688 line:80%
Are you his son who's working
as an animator in the US?

00:21:45.189 --> 00:21:46.190 line:80%
You are, right?

00:21:46.774 --> 00:21:48.817 line:80%
I heard a lot about you
from Professor Sunwoo.

00:21:49.318 --> 00:21:51.779 line:80%
He always rushes to see
any movies that get released.

00:21:51.862 --> 00:21:54.281 line:80%
He even buys tickets for his students.

00:21:57.534 --> 00:21:59.953 line:80%
[♪ slow instrumental music
playing on speakers]

00:22:03.499 --> 00:22:04.750 line:80%
[Haran clears throat]

00:22:04.833 --> 00:22:05.959 line:80%
[Haran clears throat loudly]

00:22:10.381 --> 00:22:11.799 line:80%
Can I ask you something, sir?

00:22:11.882 --> 00:22:14.593 line:80%
I heard there's a famous bakery nearby.

00:22:15.094 --> 00:22:16.303 line:80%
Do you know where it is?

00:22:17.888 --> 00:22:19.515 line:80%
-Excuse me?
-[chuckles softly]

00:22:19.598 --> 00:22:21.141 line:80%
I came here to buy bread.

00:22:21.225 --> 00:22:23.894 line:80%
I heard there's
a really famous bakery here.

00:22:26.063 --> 00:22:28.482 line:80%
[sighs] You're such a bad liar.

00:22:29.108 --> 00:22:31.652 line:80%
Were you worried
something would've happened again?

00:22:31.735 --> 00:22:33.070 line:80%
Well…

00:22:33.153 --> 00:22:35.364 line:80%
I also came to check
Daejeon's fashion trends.

00:22:35.447 --> 00:22:36.448 line:80%
[gasps] Wow.

00:22:36.532 --> 00:22:38.784 line:80%
Everyone's so fashionable here.

00:22:41.036 --> 00:22:44.456 line:80%
And I thought that if anything happened,

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:46.333 line:80%
I could give you a hug.

00:22:46.417 --> 00:22:48.752 line:80%
[inhales sharply] Look at you.

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:52.923 line:80%
When going to Gyeongju,
at the airport, and now Daejeon…

00:22:53.674 --> 00:22:56.051 line:80%
You keep surprising me like this.

00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:58.721 line:80%
You'll make me get my hopes up.

00:23:00.514 --> 00:23:03.559 line:80%
I'll keep thinking you'll appear anywhere.

00:23:06.520 --> 00:23:07.521 line:80%
Fine.

00:23:08.105 --> 00:23:11.400 line:80%
I'll appear anywhere you are,
so you can get your hopes up.

00:23:14.528 --> 00:23:15.529 line:80%
[man] Seonu Chan!

00:23:38.844 --> 00:23:41.972 line:80%
[assistant] <i>I'm so glad you've recovered.</i>

00:23:42.806 --> 00:23:45.851 line:80%
<i>Professor Sunwoo gave up on his research</i>
<i>just before presenting it</i>

00:23:45.934 --> 00:23:50.022 line:80%
<i>to go take care of you in America</i>
<i>when you were badly injured.</i>

00:23:50.105 --> 00:23:51.523 line:80%
[doctor in English]
We've done everything we can.

00:23:51.607 --> 00:23:53.817 line:80%
Now we just have to hope
that he'll pull through.

00:23:53.901 --> 00:23:55.527 line:80%
The truth is, you should be aware

00:23:55.611 --> 00:23:57.237 line:80%
it's not very likely that he'll wake up.

00:23:57.321 --> 00:23:59.573 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:24:13.754 --> 00:24:15.756 line:80%
[♪ emotional music continuing]

00:24:21.470 --> 00:24:22.471 line:80%
[in Korean] Thanks…

00:24:23.347 --> 00:24:24.556 line:80%
for the watch.

00:24:25.182 --> 00:24:26.266 line:80%
[sighs]

00:24:29.269 --> 00:24:32.773 line:80%
[exhales nervously]
Maybe you should return your degree.

00:24:34.316 --> 00:24:37.736 line:80%
A famous engineering professor
can't even fix a broken watch?

00:24:39.029 --> 00:24:41.532 line:80%
It's working well now.

00:24:43.158 --> 00:24:44.243 line:80%
Thank you…

00:24:45.327 --> 00:24:46.370 line:80%
for fixing it.

00:24:50.666 --> 00:24:51.875 line:80%
If you're grateful,

00:24:53.961 --> 00:24:56.547 line:80%
you can pay me back later.

00:25:10.477 --> 00:25:12.479 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:25:55.689 --> 00:25:56.690 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:25:56.774 --> 00:25:58.692 line:80%
Grandma called.

00:25:59.151 --> 00:26:00.778 line:80%
She thanked me and said I did well.

00:26:00.861 --> 00:26:01.862 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Really?</i>

00:26:02.571 --> 00:26:03.614 line:80%
That's great.

00:26:04.156 --> 00:26:07.076 line:80%
I'm so glad you gave it back to him.

00:26:07.159 --> 00:26:10.287 line:80%
That watch must be
dozens of times more precious now.

00:26:10.829 --> 00:26:13.499 line:80%
It could have ended
with him being sad about losing it,

00:26:13.582 --> 00:26:17.378 line:80%
but now, it's the watch that his son
fixed and returned to him.

00:26:28.472 --> 00:26:30.891 line:80%
Can I see you for a moment again?

00:26:31.392 --> 00:26:33.602 line:80%
[♪ relaxing music playing on speakers]

00:26:34.645 --> 00:26:35.646 line:80%
Huh?

00:26:38.357 --> 00:26:39.650 line:80%
How did you…

00:26:39.733 --> 00:26:42.903 line:80%
Remember when we went to that restaurant?

00:26:43.696 --> 00:26:45.990 line:80%
When I was in bad shape because of my ear.

00:26:46.490 --> 00:26:47.574 line:80%
-[high-pitched ringing]
-[groans]

00:26:47.658 --> 00:26:48.701 line:80%
[server yelps]

00:26:48.784 --> 00:26:50.995 line:80%
It's noisy in there.
I'll go bring our stuff.

00:26:51.453 --> 00:26:54.623 line:80%
It must have gotten mixed up
in my stuff back then.

00:26:55.582 --> 00:26:57.876 line:80%
I found it
when I unpacked my luggage here.

00:26:58.752 --> 00:26:59.753 line:80%
Ah…

00:27:03.215 --> 00:27:05.509 line:80%
I don't need it anymore, though.

00:27:11.265 --> 00:27:12.850 line:80%
I'm already using a different one.

00:27:13.309 --> 00:27:15.519 line:80%
Plus, I have dozens of pens now.

00:27:15.602 --> 00:27:18.355 line:80%
Someone gave me a whole bunch
as a gift. [chuckles softly]

00:27:21.025 --> 00:27:22.860 line:80%
That's why I'm giving it back now.

00:27:22.943 --> 00:27:23.986 line:80%
I…

00:27:25.029 --> 00:27:27.072 line:80%
was worried that I'd remind you

00:27:27.990 --> 00:27:30.284 line:80%
of the memories back then.

00:27:31.118 --> 00:27:33.245 line:80%
But I thought you wouldn't be wavered now.

00:27:34.705 --> 00:27:38.500 line:80%
Just think of it as a pen
that's the most effective and use it.

00:27:40.044 --> 00:27:44.256 line:80%
I know how important it is
to have a tool that fits you just right

00:27:44.340 --> 00:27:46.175 line:80%
since I'm an animator.

00:27:47.343 --> 00:27:49.970 line:80%
I can just get used to this pen.

00:27:53.599 --> 00:27:55.309 line:80%
Let me borrow this for a second.

00:28:00.314 --> 00:28:02.274 line:80%
[♪ pleasant song playing]

00:28:02.358 --> 00:28:04.360 line:80%
[pen scraping]

00:28:10.199 --> 00:28:12.618 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:28:14.453 --> 00:28:16.538 line:80%
Just consider this pen

00:28:17.247 --> 00:28:20.250 line:80%
a pen that I found for you,
not a pen that you got as a gift

00:28:22.002 --> 00:28:25.005 line:80%
or a pen that made you sad
when you lost it.

00:28:26.548 --> 00:28:29.968 line:80%
And… here's a lucky charm.

00:28:30.052 --> 00:28:33.055 line:80%
You know you'll get lucky
once you see an iridescent cloud.

00:28:33.764 --> 00:28:35.474 line:80%
You can see one every day now,

00:28:36.058 --> 00:28:38.936 line:80%
so you'll be lucky every day.
[chuckles softly]

00:28:44.316 --> 00:28:47.027 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[inhales sharply, grunts]

00:28:47.111 --> 00:28:48.237 line:80%
Just use it.

00:28:50.864 --> 00:28:54.034 line:80%
I sincerely want you to use it again.

00:28:58.580 --> 00:28:59.581 line:80%
All right.

00:29:00.874 --> 00:29:02.167 line:80%
I will.

00:29:04.837 --> 00:29:06.714 line:80%
It's the pen you found for me now.

00:29:22.021 --> 00:29:23.522 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:29:25.107 --> 00:29:26.317 line:80%
Hello?

00:29:29.236 --> 00:29:30.237 line:80%
[exclaims] Really?

00:29:31.655 --> 00:29:33.574 line:80%
[exclaims softly] All right.

00:29:33.657 --> 00:29:35.534 line:80%
Thank you. Okay.

00:29:36.660 --> 00:29:37.661 line:80%
[sighs]

00:29:39.038 --> 00:29:40.372 line:80%
No way.

00:29:41.290 --> 00:29:43.375 line:80%
-This is crazy.
-What is it?

00:29:43.459 --> 00:29:45.127 line:80%
Something good really happened.

00:29:45.794 --> 00:29:47.379 line:80%
I'm receiving an award.

00:29:47.463 --> 00:29:49.548 line:80%
The Best Designer Award
at the Fashion Awards.

00:29:50.174 --> 00:29:52.134 line:80%
See? I told you that you'd be lucky.

00:29:52.217 --> 00:29:54.428 line:80%
-[chuckles softly]
-Congratulations.

00:29:56.138 --> 00:29:57.139 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:30:09.401 --> 00:30:10.778 line:80%
[Manjae] Genius.

00:30:12.279 --> 00:30:13.656 line:80%
Are you here?

00:30:13.739 --> 00:30:14.740 line:80%
Huh?

00:30:15.908 --> 00:30:16.909 line:80%
Hey, Genius.

00:30:18.410 --> 00:30:19.411 line:80%
[Genius barks]

00:30:20.120 --> 00:30:21.330 line:80%
Is there something there?

00:30:23.457 --> 00:30:24.875 line:80%
[Manjae exclaims] What…

00:30:25.709 --> 00:30:26.710 line:80%
Nabong!

00:30:26.794 --> 00:30:28.003 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:30:28.087 --> 00:30:30.130 line:80%
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:30:30.214 --> 00:30:31.298 line:80%
Hey, Manjae.

00:30:31.799 --> 00:30:35.386 line:80%
I wanted to get a cup of coffee
after I finished work,

00:30:35.469 --> 00:30:37.137 line:80%
but I didn't realize it was so late.

00:30:38.847 --> 00:30:41.976 line:80%
The snow was beautiful,
so I was watching it for a bit.

00:30:42.059 --> 00:30:43.686 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-It's so late…

00:30:43.769 --> 00:30:45.688 line:80%
And you're dressed so lightly.

00:30:46.146 --> 00:30:47.147 line:80%
It's cold.

00:30:47.231 --> 00:30:48.482 line:80%
Come on, let's go inside.

00:30:50.734 --> 00:30:52.069 line:80%
Get yourself warmed up.

00:30:54.655 --> 00:30:56.949 line:80%
What on earth is going on?

00:30:57.032 --> 00:30:59.952 line:80%
I was so absorbed in work,
I didn't notice the time.

00:31:00.577 --> 00:31:02.746 line:80%
You know how focused I can get.

00:31:07.209 --> 00:31:08.627 line:80%
Are you sure nothing's wrong?

00:31:10.587 --> 00:31:12.047 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:31:12.131 --> 00:31:13.507 line:80%
Is everything really okay?

00:31:13.590 --> 00:31:15.592 line:80%
Is this some trending challenge?

00:31:16.093 --> 00:31:18.595 line:80%
Why is everyone asking me that? [chuckles]

00:31:19.763 --> 00:31:22.975 line:80%
Did I neglect my skincare
because I was too busy?

00:31:32.401 --> 00:31:34.862 line:80%
Have some warm tea.

00:31:50.627 --> 00:31:51.962 line:80%
[sighs]

00:31:53.130 --> 00:31:54.381 line:80%
[Manjae] What on earth

00:31:55.174 --> 00:31:57.426 line:80%
is going on with you?

00:32:02.514 --> 00:32:03.515 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:32:03.599 --> 00:32:05.601 line:80%
[♪ upbeat music playing on speakers]

00:32:12.066 --> 00:32:14.193 line:80%
LAUNDRY DETERGENT
LAVENDER

00:32:16.278 --> 00:32:18.072 line:80%
[woman] Aren't you my Hadam?

00:32:18.155 --> 00:32:20.199 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:32:21.742 --> 00:32:22.910 line:80%
It's me.

00:32:24.161 --> 00:32:25.829 line:80%
Mom.

00:32:27.122 --> 00:32:28.457 line:80%
Mom?

00:32:29.625 --> 00:32:30.834 line:80%
-Oh, my goodness!
-[♪ music fades]

00:32:30.918 --> 00:32:33.045 line:80%
I finally got to meet you.

00:32:33.128 --> 00:32:34.838 line:80%
I wanted to see you so much.

00:32:34.922 --> 00:32:37.633 line:80%
It's me, Yougyum's mom.

00:32:37.716 --> 00:32:39.385 line:80%
What? Ah…

00:32:40.511 --> 00:32:41.512 line:80%
Ah!

00:32:42.346 --> 00:32:43.514 line:80%
Hello.

00:32:43.597 --> 00:32:45.724 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom]
Goodness, it's so nice to meet you.

00:32:45.808 --> 00:32:47.559 line:80%
I recognized you right away.

00:32:47.643 --> 00:32:50.646 line:80%
Our house is plastered with photos of you.

00:32:50.729 --> 00:32:53.691 line:80%
-[chuckles awkwardly]
-I feel like I'm meeting a celebrity.

00:32:53.774 --> 00:32:57.695 line:80%
If it's all right, could I give you a hug?

00:33:02.116 --> 00:33:04.994 line:80%
[chuckling] My dear Hadam.

00:33:05.077 --> 00:33:08.288 line:80%
It's so nice to see you.

00:33:08.372 --> 00:33:10.374 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:33:11.917 --> 00:33:13.627 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:33:14.461 --> 00:33:16.213 line:80%
[whimpering]

00:33:16.296 --> 00:33:18.716 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom] What's wrong? What is it?

00:33:19.550 --> 00:33:24.680 line:80%
[Hyewon] ♪ <i>Sleep well, dear Hadam </i>♪

00:33:24.763 --> 00:33:29.018 line:80%
♪ <i>Sleep in Mommy's arms </i>♪

00:33:29.101 --> 00:33:34.106 line:80%
♪ <i>Sleep well, dear Hadam </i>♪

00:33:34.606 --> 00:33:38.902 line:80%
♪ <i>Sleep tight </i>♪

00:33:38.986 --> 00:33:40.154 line:80%
I found…

00:33:44.325 --> 00:33:45.617 line:80%
Mom's smell.

00:33:46.952 --> 00:33:48.120 line:80%
[Hadam crying]

00:33:52.750 --> 00:33:54.084 line:80%
-[stomach rumbles]
-[gasps]

00:33:57.921 --> 00:34:00.090 line:80%
[laughing]

00:34:00.591 --> 00:34:02.885 line:80%
Come on. I'll make you a meal.

00:34:04.053 --> 00:34:06.555 line:80%
[laughing] Let's go.

00:34:07.348 --> 00:34:08.807 line:80%
[man in English] Excuse me.

00:34:08.891 --> 00:34:10.434 line:80%
Where is the grocery store?

00:34:10.517 --> 00:34:11.727 line:80%
-[steam hissing]
-[♪ music fades]

00:34:11.810 --> 00:34:13.187 line:80%
[chuckles] Excuse me.

00:34:13.270 --> 00:34:14.813 line:80%
Where is the grocery store?

00:34:14.897 --> 00:34:17.566 line:80%
-[Yougyum's mom in Korean] Honey.
-Come on in.

00:34:17.650 --> 00:34:18.651 line:80%
[chuckling]

00:34:20.861 --> 00:34:22.112 line:80%
Hello.

00:34:22.738 --> 00:34:23.989 line:80%
Look who it is!

00:34:24.073 --> 00:34:25.658 line:80%
Isn't she our superstar?

00:34:25.741 --> 00:34:27.534 line:80%
-Our dear Hadam.
-Ah…

00:34:27.618 --> 00:34:29.244 line:80%
We told Yougyum to bring you,

00:34:29.328 --> 00:34:31.455 line:80%
but he said
we shouldn't bother your studies

00:34:31.538 --> 00:34:34.124 line:80%
and kept you hidden all along.

00:34:34.208 --> 00:34:36.043 line:80%
I ran into her by chance
at the supermarket.

00:34:36.126 --> 00:34:37.795 line:80%
Welcome.

00:34:37.878 --> 00:34:38.962 line:80%
Did you eat?

00:34:39.046 --> 00:34:40.214 line:80%
Join us for a meal.

00:34:40.297 --> 00:34:41.423 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:34:41.507 --> 00:34:45.010 line:80%
Gosh. I told you to bring me
when you're buying heavy stuff.

00:34:45.094 --> 00:34:47.304 line:80%
I'll bring these upstairs. [chuckles]

00:34:47.388 --> 00:34:48.639 line:80%
-[thuds]
-[groans] Gosh!

00:34:48.722 --> 00:34:50.057 line:80%
My goodness.

00:34:50.641 --> 00:34:52.643 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom and Hadam chuckle]

00:34:54.019 --> 00:34:57.231 line:80%
[Hadam exclaims] I can't believe him.

00:35:02.152 --> 00:35:04.363 line:80%
LET'S BE SOMEONE HADAM WILL BE PROUD OF!

00:35:05.239 --> 00:35:07.616 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom] I wondered why
he only got perfect scores in English.

00:35:08.075 --> 00:35:10.285 line:80%
I heard you told him in your first year.

00:35:10.369 --> 00:35:11.954 line:80%
The Major League?

00:35:12.037 --> 00:35:13.580 line:80%
If that's your goal,

00:35:13.664 --> 00:35:16.542 line:80%
shouldn't you at least
study English in advance?

00:35:16.625 --> 00:35:19.169 line:80%
[in English] I want to be better
than I was yesterday.

00:35:19.503 --> 00:35:20.504 line:80%
"Challenge."

00:35:20.838 --> 00:35:21.839 line:80%
[in Korean] Challenge.

00:35:21.922 --> 00:35:24.967 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom] Since then,
his father has been studying English, too.

00:35:25.050 --> 00:35:27.052 line:80%
He said he wants to help Yougyum.

00:35:27.136 --> 00:35:29.805 line:80%
This is how much influence
you have over our family.

00:35:29.888 --> 00:35:30.889 line:80%
[chuckles shyly]

00:35:30.973 --> 00:35:32.224 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:35:32.308 --> 00:35:33.809 line:80%
He's unbelievable.

00:35:33.892 --> 00:35:36.478 line:80%
[Yougyum's dad]
Honey, should I braise the fish?

00:35:36.562 --> 00:35:37.730 line:80%
Hang on.

00:35:37.813 --> 00:35:39.523 line:80%
-Sorry. Take a look around.
-Okay.

00:35:44.153 --> 00:35:47.823 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom]
<i>But how did you end up dating Yougyum?</i>

00:35:47.906 --> 00:35:50.868 line:80%
<i>He said he had a crush on you</i>
<i>since elementary school.</i>

00:35:50.951 --> 00:35:53.412 line:80%
[Hadam] <i>Thinking back,</i>

00:35:53.912 --> 00:35:56.373 line:80%
<i>he was the only one who understood me.</i>

00:35:56.457 --> 00:35:58.292 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:35:58.375 --> 00:36:00.669 line:80%
[kid 1] <i>Why aren't your parents</i>
<i>here for the field day?</i>

00:36:00.753 --> 00:36:04.256 line:80%
[kid 2] Hey, she's the poor kid
whose parents both died.

00:36:04.340 --> 00:36:05.841 line:80%
[kid 1] Really? That's so pitiful.

00:36:05.924 --> 00:36:09.887 line:80%
Hey, having your parents
pass away isn't pitiful.

00:36:09.970 --> 00:36:11.180 line:80%
It's just sad.

00:36:12.556 --> 00:36:13.891 line:80%
[Hadam groans]

00:36:14.892 --> 00:36:17.645 line:80%
I solved this when I stayed up
studying last night.

00:36:17.728 --> 00:36:19.021 line:80%
Hadam.

00:36:19.772 --> 00:36:23.025 line:80%
In baseball, throwing pull power
every time will strain your body.

00:36:23.108 --> 00:36:25.319 line:80%
You need a breather to grow stronger.

00:36:25.402 --> 00:36:26.945 line:80%
A breather?

00:36:28.280 --> 00:36:29.281 line:80%
That's why…

00:36:32.159 --> 00:36:33.285 line:80%
you need a breather now.

00:36:35.079 --> 00:36:37.331 line:80%
All right. Pitcher Cha Yougyum
is ready to throw.

00:36:39.875 --> 00:36:40.876 line:80%
-[Yougyum groans]
-[sighs]

00:36:42.127 --> 00:36:43.128 line:80%
[both exclaim excitedly]

00:36:43.212 --> 00:36:44.254 line:80%
I hit it!

00:36:44.338 --> 00:36:45.714 line:80%
Run, Hadam!

00:36:47.049 --> 00:36:48.342 line:80%
Go!

00:36:48.425 --> 00:36:50.469 line:80%
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:36:53.681 --> 00:36:54.765 line:80%
Right.

00:36:58.352 --> 00:37:01.772 line:80%
Yougyum always understood me.

00:37:02.940 --> 00:37:05.025 line:80%
-[♪ music ends]
-[cell phone buzzes]

00:37:09.405 --> 00:37:12.157 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>Nabong, guess what I found?</i>

00:37:13.409 --> 00:37:14.410 line:80%
[gasps softly]

00:37:14.493 --> 00:37:16.328 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:37:21.458 --> 00:37:24.336 line:80%
Manjae, where did you get that photo?

00:37:24.420 --> 00:37:25.462 line:80%
Oh. [chuckles]

00:37:25.546 --> 00:37:27.464 line:80%
I was organizing my vinyl collection,

00:37:27.548 --> 00:37:30.426 line:80%
-and it just fell out.
-[Nana gasps on phone]

00:37:30.509 --> 00:37:33.595 line:80%
I can't believe it.
That was such a long time ago.

00:37:33.679 --> 00:37:35.264 line:80%
I wonder if that tree is still there.

00:37:36.223 --> 00:37:40.978 line:80%
Remember the <i>tteokbokki </i>place
we used to go to in the market?

00:37:41.395 --> 00:37:42.479 line:80%
What was it called?

00:37:42.563 --> 00:37:44.690 line:80%
-Ah! Fat Tteokbokki.
-Fat Tteokbokki.

00:37:44.773 --> 00:37:46.567 line:80%
-[Manjae] <i>Right?</i>
-[laughs]

00:37:46.650 --> 00:37:48.068 line:80%
[laughs]

00:37:48.152 --> 00:37:51.238 line:80%
Ah… I'm craving
that super sweet <i>tteokbokki.</i>

00:37:51.989 --> 00:37:54.992 line:80%
Do you want to go
have <i>tteokbokki </i>this evening?

00:37:56.660 --> 00:37:58.162 line:80%
[hesitates] No…

00:37:58.245 --> 00:38:00.622 line:80%
You shouldn't ditch work, right?

00:38:00.706 --> 00:38:02.249 line:80%
Come on.

00:38:02.333 --> 00:38:05.586 line:80%
Nabong, have you forgotten
that I'm the owner?

00:38:06.628 --> 00:38:08.422 line:80%
I can totally ditch work.

00:38:08.505 --> 00:38:09.506 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:38:10.382 --> 00:38:11.425 line:80%
Well, well.

00:38:11.508 --> 00:38:14.011 line:80%
I caught you. Are you ditching work?

00:38:14.094 --> 00:38:15.763 line:80%
No, I'm receiving an award.

00:38:15.846 --> 00:38:18.098 line:80%
Oh, right. The Fashion Awards is today.

00:38:18.182 --> 00:38:19.975 line:80%
-Congratulations.
-[chuckles softly]

00:38:20.059 --> 00:38:21.352 line:80%
See you.

00:38:22.936 --> 00:38:24.938 line:80%
[♪ heart-fluttering music playing]

00:38:25.022 --> 00:38:26.732 line:80%
[footsteps echoing]

00:38:29.526 --> 00:38:30.986 line:80%
[Raemee exclaims] <i>Love.</i>

00:38:31.070 --> 00:38:33.906 line:80%
<i>That means you like him too.</i>

00:38:33.989 --> 00:38:35.783 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>No way.</i>

00:38:35.866 --> 00:38:36.867 line:80%
<i>Was he right?</i>

00:38:36.950 --> 00:38:40.162 line:80%
<i>Why does he look so cool</i>
<i>when he's just walking?</i>

00:38:40.245 --> 00:38:41.497 line:80%
[suit rustle echoes]

00:38:45.376 --> 00:38:47.044 line:80%
<i>Why am I blushing?</i>

00:38:47.127 --> 00:38:48.671 line:80%
<i>And why am I sweating?</i>

00:38:55.886 --> 00:38:58.138 line:80%
Are you free this evening?

00:38:58.222 --> 00:39:00.724 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>This evening?</i>
<i>Not morning or afternoon?</i>

00:39:01.350 --> 00:39:03.769 line:80%
<i>Is he asking me out?</i>

00:39:03.852 --> 00:39:05.729 line:80%
[gasps inwardly] <i>On a date?</i>

00:39:05.813 --> 00:39:07.898 line:80%
I got a reply that the factory

00:39:07.982 --> 00:39:10.442 line:80%
couldn't get any of the bio silk
you talked about.

00:39:10.526 --> 00:39:11.735 line:80%
I did more research

00:39:11.819 --> 00:39:15.406 line:80%
and got in touch with an industry
tech reporter who wrote about it.

00:39:15.489 --> 00:39:17.282 line:80%
We're meeting this evening.

00:39:17.366 --> 00:39:19.618 line:80%
We may find a way to do it.

00:39:19.702 --> 00:39:22.955 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>Mr. Yeon's cheeks</i>
<i>seem a little red, too.</i>

00:39:23.455 --> 00:39:25.666 line:80%
<i>Huh? And he's sweating.</i>

00:39:25.749 --> 00:39:27.001 line:80%
<i>Was Raemee really right?</i>

00:39:27.084 --> 00:39:30.045 line:80%
<i>Then we really like each other?</i>

00:39:30.629 --> 00:39:32.172 line:80%
[clinking]

00:39:33.090 --> 00:39:35.801 line:80%
Great job with the meeting.

00:39:39.513 --> 00:39:40.931 line:80%
How about some wine?

00:39:41.015 --> 00:39:42.349 line:80%
Just you and me,

00:39:42.933 --> 00:39:43.976 line:80%
alone.

00:39:44.810 --> 00:39:46.854 line:80%
Sure. I'd like that.

00:39:47.438 --> 00:39:49.064 line:80%
Pardon? Uh…

00:39:49.690 --> 00:39:51.900 line:80%
Are you saying you'll come?

00:39:52.651 --> 00:39:53.652 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:39:53.736 --> 00:39:54.987 line:80%
Ah.

00:39:55.070 --> 00:39:57.031 line:80%
Yes, I'm free.

00:39:57.114 --> 00:39:59.033 line:80%
I'll drive, then.

00:39:59.116 --> 00:40:01.327 line:80%
I'll see you at the parking lot
at 7:00 p.m.

00:40:06.707 --> 00:40:07.708 line:80%
[sighs]

00:40:08.500 --> 00:40:10.794 line:80%
Why are we meeting at 7:00 p.m.?

00:40:12.463 --> 00:40:13.881 line:80%
Right.

00:40:13.964 --> 00:40:15.007 line:80%
The new material.

00:40:16.342 --> 00:40:17.343 line:80%
The meeting.

00:40:17.426 --> 00:40:18.761 line:80%
GYUM'S LAUNDRY

00:40:18.844 --> 00:40:20.387 line:80%
[Yougyum] I'm home.

00:40:23.474 --> 00:40:24.683 line:80%
Mom.

00:40:24.767 --> 00:40:27.019 line:80%
Mom, I must have lost my mind.

00:40:27.102 --> 00:40:30.564 line:80%
I miss Hadam so much,
I must be hallucinating.

00:40:32.274 --> 00:40:34.193 line:80%
But… [breathing shakily]

00:40:34.276 --> 00:40:37.071 line:80%
it's still so nice to see her.

00:40:37.154 --> 00:40:39.156 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:40:40.991 --> 00:40:41.992 line:80%
[Yougyum sniffles]

00:40:42.701 --> 00:40:43.869 line:80%
You idiot.

00:40:44.787 --> 00:40:46.038 line:80%
It's really me.

00:40:46.664 --> 00:40:48.040 line:80%
Wow.

00:40:48.123 --> 00:40:49.291 line:80%
She's even talking now.

00:40:50.042 --> 00:40:53.671 line:80%
I must have gone crazy
from missing her so much.

00:40:53.754 --> 00:40:55.172 line:80%
You idiot.

00:40:56.590 --> 00:40:58.258 line:80%
It really is me.

00:40:59.760 --> 00:41:02.930 line:80%
[stuttering] Is it really you?

00:41:03.013 --> 00:41:04.932 line:80%
You're really Hadam?

00:41:05.015 --> 00:41:07.518 line:80%
I didn't give Seokhyeon my number.

00:41:07.601 --> 00:41:11.397 line:80%
Someone left a drink at my seat
with a heart post-it,

00:41:11.480 --> 00:41:13.816 line:80%
and I rushed out thinking it was from you.

00:41:14.274 --> 00:41:16.819 line:80%
When I heard it was from Seokhyeon,
I gave it back to him.

00:41:21.031 --> 00:41:22.032 line:80%
Really?

00:41:22.658 --> 00:41:23.951 line:80%
I'm sorry I misunderstood.

00:41:24.535 --> 00:41:26.412 line:80%
I wasn't having fun at karaoke either.

00:41:26.495 --> 00:41:28.747 line:80%
My friends took me there to comfort me,

00:41:29.331 --> 00:41:31.417 line:80%
but I just kept crying
at the thought of you.

00:41:31.500 --> 00:41:33.585 line:80%
I'm sorry I misunderstood you, too.

00:41:34.670 --> 00:41:37.297 line:80%
But why are you wearing glasses?

00:41:37.798 --> 00:41:39.174 line:80%
Has your eyesight gotten bad?

00:41:39.717 --> 00:41:40.718 line:80%
No,

00:41:42.094 --> 00:41:43.387 line:80%
I don't need them now.

00:41:43.470 --> 00:41:46.265 line:80%
And you? Why were you
at the nurse's office? Were you sick?

00:41:47.891 --> 00:41:48.892 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:41:48.976 --> 00:41:50.728 line:80%
I just got a small cut on my hand,

00:41:51.478 --> 00:41:53.105 line:80%
-but I'm all better now.
-[sniffling]

00:41:59.445 --> 00:42:01.739 line:80%
[both crying]

00:42:01.822 --> 00:42:03.407 line:80%
I'm sorry, Hadam.

00:42:03.490 --> 00:42:05.784 line:80%
[crying] I'm more sorry.

00:42:05.868 --> 00:42:07.619 line:80%
[Yougyum] I missed you so much.

00:42:07.703 --> 00:42:10.456 line:80%
[Hadam] I missed you even more.

00:42:10.539 --> 00:42:13.542 line:80%
-[♪ grandiose music playing on speakers]
-[announcer] The Best Designer Award.

00:42:13.625 --> 00:42:16.003 line:80%
-Nana Atelier, Song Haran.
-[applause]

00:42:16.086 --> 00:42:17.963 line:80%
There are two winners this year.

00:42:18.047 --> 00:42:20.424 line:80%
-Onne Apparel, Kang Eunchan.
-[cameras clicking]

00:42:20.507 --> 00:42:21.800 line:80%
[applause]

00:42:31.352 --> 00:42:32.353 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:42:32.436 --> 00:42:33.437 line:80%
[Eunchan] Haran.

00:42:33.896 --> 00:42:36.440 line:80%
I have to go to the factory.
There's a fabric issue.

00:42:36.523 --> 00:42:39.026 line:80%
I booked a table at Haeon,
the restaurant nearby.

00:42:40.277 --> 00:42:41.320 line:80%
Take this and go there.

00:42:41.403 --> 00:42:45.074 line:80%
I said I'd buy dinner for my brother,
but I can't let him eat alone.

00:42:45.157 --> 00:42:47.576 line:80%
Sorry, but just have dinner
with him, okay?

00:42:48.952 --> 00:42:51.580 line:20%
-♪ <i>Happy birthday to you </i>♪
-[clapping]

00:42:51.664 --> 00:42:53.666 line:80%
-[♪ pleasant music playing]
-♪ <i>Happy birthday… </i>♪

00:42:53.749 --> 00:42:55.125 line:80%
-[yawns]
-[chuckles]

00:42:55.793 --> 00:42:59.088 line:80%
I'm sorry. I haven't slept
for the past three days.

00:42:59.171 --> 00:43:01.090 line:80%
Sorry. Right.

00:43:01.173 --> 00:43:02.716 line:80%
♪ <i>Happy birthday, dear… </i>♪

00:43:02.800 --> 00:43:04.218 line:80%
Kang Hyeokchan.

00:43:04.301 --> 00:43:06.178 line:80%
♪ <i>Kang Hyeokchan </i>♪

00:43:06.261 --> 00:43:08.055 line:80%
♪ <i>Happy birthday to you </i>♪

00:43:08.138 --> 00:43:09.181 line:80%
[cheers]

00:43:12.977 --> 00:43:15.604 line:80%
A Mr. Kang from our house
asked me to give it to you.

00:43:16.063 --> 00:43:17.606 line:80%
-What?
-Good luck.

00:43:18.273 --> 00:43:19.650 line:20%
VITAMINS FOR ENERGY
A CUSHION FOR A NAP

00:43:19.733 --> 00:43:21.235 line:80%
CHOCOLATE AFTER LUNCH
CHAMOMILE AFTER WORK

00:43:21.318 --> 00:43:22.361 line:80%
WITH THESE, YOU CAN SLEEP BETTER

00:43:23.988 --> 00:43:24.989 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:43:29.284 --> 00:43:30.744 line:80%
[kisses, chuckles]

00:43:30.828 --> 00:43:32.037 line:80%
-I love you.
-Hmm?

00:43:33.038 --> 00:43:34.123 line:80%
That's so sudden.

00:43:35.249 --> 00:43:36.917 line:80%
-[scoffs]
-[cell phone vibrating]

00:43:38.293 --> 00:43:39.545 line:80%
[sighs wearily]

00:43:40.129 --> 00:43:41.130 line:80%
It's work.

00:43:42.214 --> 00:43:44.008 line:80%
Good luck with the embassy interview.

00:43:47.386 --> 00:43:48.429 line:80%
Hello?

00:43:48.762 --> 00:43:51.932 line:80%
[sighs] I can't believe I have to work
when you're leaving.

00:43:52.016 --> 00:43:53.350 line:80%
I'm so sorry, Chan.

00:43:54.059 --> 00:43:55.311 line:80%
It's fine.

00:43:55.394 --> 00:43:57.646 line:80%
I told you I won't get upset
about you being busy.

00:43:57.730 --> 00:43:59.815 line:80%
<i>I'll be back during vacation. I love you.</i>

00:43:59.898 --> 00:44:01.150 line:80%
I'm so sorry.

00:44:01.233 --> 00:44:02.901 line:80%
Leave me a message when you arrive.

00:44:03.193 --> 00:44:04.194 line:80%
[cell phone pings]

00:44:04.278 --> 00:44:07.740 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>I can't go back to Korea</i>
<i>because of my lab schedule.</i>

00:44:07.823 --> 00:44:10.743 line:80%
<i>And my phone's broken,</i>
<i>so I won't be able to text for a while.</i>

00:44:11.410 --> 00:44:13.495 line:80%
<i>Leave me a message</i>
<i>if there's anything urgent.</i>

00:44:13.579 --> 00:44:15.247 line:80%
[Hayeong] I knew it.

00:44:15.706 --> 00:44:17.624 line:80%
Are you sure he just doesn't want to come?

00:44:18.125 --> 00:44:20.544 line:80%
-What?
-Well, I haven't seen it myself,

00:44:20.627 --> 00:44:23.255 line:80%
but he was so nice to you
when he was in Seoul.

00:44:23.339 --> 00:44:26.050 line:80%
But you were always busy
and didn't keep in touch often.

00:44:26.133 --> 00:44:27.760 line:80%
You didn't even show much affection.

00:44:27.843 --> 00:44:29.470 line:80%
You'll get dumped at this rate.

00:44:29.553 --> 00:44:32.222 line:80%
[sighs] You're right.
I guess I deserve it.

00:44:33.223 --> 00:44:34.433 line:80%
That's too bad.

00:44:34.516 --> 00:44:36.602 line:80%
What's that reaction?

00:44:36.685 --> 00:44:38.604 line:80%
Do you even like Hyeokchan?

00:44:38.687 --> 00:44:41.231 line:80%
Of course I do. He's my boyfriend.

00:44:41.315 --> 00:44:43.025 line:80%
[Hayeong] No, not like that.

00:44:43.609 --> 00:44:44.860 line:80%
Do you love him?

00:44:45.486 --> 00:44:46.487 line:80%
[Haran] Mmm?

00:44:47.029 --> 00:44:48.364 line:80%
[Eunchan] Did Chan send that?

00:44:48.447 --> 00:44:50.699 line:80%
He sent a drawing pen
for his designer girlfriend?

00:44:51.784 --> 00:44:54.620 line:80%
Wow. And even with your name
engraved on it?

00:44:56.747 --> 00:44:59.667 line:80%
[Haran] <i>But how did you come up</i>
<i>with the idea of sending me a pen?</i>

00:44:59.750 --> 00:45:01.085 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:45:01.168 --> 00:45:03.545 line:20%
I KEPT THINKING ABOUT HOW YOU SAID
YOU FELT LIKE YOU WERE TRAPPED

00:45:03.629 --> 00:45:05.589 line:20%
I GUESS I WANTED THAT PEN
TO BE THAT "IF" FOR YOU

00:45:05.673 --> 00:45:06.799 line:80%
[sighs]

00:45:07.299 --> 00:45:09.968 line:80%
Chan understands me so well…

00:45:10.636 --> 00:45:11.637 line:80%
SORRY, I WAS RAMBLING

00:45:12.596 --> 00:45:16.225 line:80%
I miss you, Hyeokchan.

00:45:17.559 --> 00:45:20.312 line:80%
Ta-da! I'm at the airport!

00:45:20.437 --> 00:45:22.523 line:80%
I wanted to tell you something in person.

00:45:22.898 --> 00:45:25.025 line:80%
Chan. I love you.

00:45:26.527 --> 00:45:28.612 line:80%
I love you, Chan. [chuckles]

00:45:28.696 --> 00:45:30.072 line:80%
[Eunchan] <i>Haran, what do I do?</i>

00:45:30.155 --> 00:45:31.156 line:80%
<i>Chan…</i>

00:45:31.657 --> 00:45:34.284 line:80%
<i>-Hyeokchan is dead.</i>
-[siren blaring]

00:45:41.375 --> 00:45:43.502 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[applause]

00:45:47.131 --> 00:45:48.924 line:80%
[Eunchan] I moved to Onne Apparel.

00:45:50.134 --> 00:45:53.595 line:80%
It's awkward giving you my business card.

00:45:57.016 --> 00:45:58.934 line:80%
Have you been well?

00:46:01.395 --> 00:46:02.563 line:80%
It's already been…

00:46:03.689 --> 00:46:04.690 line:80%
seven years.

00:46:06.025 --> 00:46:08.777 line:80%
I always wondered how you were doing,

00:46:09.320 --> 00:46:10.988 line:80%
but I felt too guilty to contact you.

00:46:11.739 --> 00:46:14.533 line:80%
Why would you feel guilty?

00:46:22.875 --> 00:46:24.752 line:80%
-What is it?
-Oh…

00:46:26.128 --> 00:46:29.340 line:80%
Were you getting checkups here?

00:46:29.423 --> 00:46:30.424 line:80%
Huh?

00:46:31.342 --> 00:46:33.093 line:80%
Ahh.

00:46:33.177 --> 00:46:36.472 line:80%
I was at a different ER
when I collapsed last time.

00:46:36.555 --> 00:46:37.848 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:46:37.931 --> 00:46:40.434 line:80%
I got a referral, so I come here.

00:46:40.517 --> 00:46:41.685 line:80%
It's closer.

00:46:41.769 --> 00:46:43.103 line:80%
-What is it?
-Ah…

00:46:43.812 --> 00:46:47.358 line:80%
I got treated here before.
[chuckles softly]

00:46:48.317 --> 00:46:51.236 line:80%
I'll go ask where we can get the results.

00:46:57.368 --> 00:46:58.911 line:80%
We have to go to the annex.

00:46:59.536 --> 00:47:00.621 line:80%
Really?

00:47:01.580 --> 00:47:03.832 line:80%
But why are you dressed up today?

00:47:05.000 --> 00:47:06.210 line:80%
[Manjae] Hmm?

00:47:06.293 --> 00:47:09.588 line:80%
I have to be dressed up
to go somewhere later.

00:47:10.172 --> 00:47:12.091 line:80%
-[inhales sharply] Mmm…
-[Manjae chuckles]

00:47:12.174 --> 00:47:13.342 line:80%
[Chan] Where are you going?

00:47:18.847 --> 00:47:19.848 line:80%
[automation] <i>The door is closing.</i>

00:47:19.932 --> 00:47:22.267 line:80%
[automation in English]
<i>The door is closing.</i>

00:47:23.435 --> 00:47:25.688 line:80%
[metallic clinking]

00:47:28.857 --> 00:47:31.276 line:80%
[metallic clinking]

00:47:31.610 --> 00:47:32.861 line:80%
[elevator dings]

00:47:36.573 --> 00:47:38.784 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:47:38.867 --> 00:47:41.662 line:80%
[in Korean] Huh? Hey, roomie!

00:47:42.246 --> 00:47:43.497 line:80%
[pants]

00:47:46.125 --> 00:47:47.751 line:80%
[metallic clinking echoes]

00:47:48.836 --> 00:47:51.005 line:80%
[metallic clinking]

00:47:57.636 --> 00:47:59.888 line:80%
-[cell phone vibrating]
-[panting]

00:48:02.641 --> 00:48:03.642 line:80%
Mr. Park.

00:48:04.977 --> 00:48:07.646 line:80%
Sorry, I'll head over there.

00:48:10.190 --> 00:48:11.191 line:80%
Okay.

00:48:17.489 --> 00:48:20.284 line:80%
[professor] <i>Visiting neurology resident</i>
<i>from Boston General Hospital,</i>

00:48:20.367 --> 00:48:21.535 line:80%
Cha Sujin.

00:48:22.077 --> 00:48:23.287 line:80%
I'm Cha Sujin.

00:48:23.370 --> 00:48:25.456 line:80%
I'll do my best
to learn as much as I can here.

00:48:25.539 --> 00:48:27.333 line:80%
-Nice to meet you all.
-[applause]

00:48:32.338 --> 00:48:33.505 line:80%
[doctor] Dr. Cha.

00:48:33.589 --> 00:48:35.090 line:80%
You shouldn't wear accessories here.

00:48:35.174 --> 00:48:38.427 line:80%
Sorry. I forgot to take it off.

00:48:39.928 --> 00:48:42.306 line:80%
MEDICAL STAFF SEARCH

00:48:42.389 --> 00:48:45.267 line:20%
LEE SUJIN

00:48:46.435 --> 00:48:48.228 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'm sure she was in a gown.</i>

00:48:50.147 --> 00:48:52.983 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:48:55.235 --> 00:48:56.236 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:48:56.320 --> 00:48:57.321 line:80%
All right.

00:48:57.946 --> 00:48:59.657 line:80%
I got the results. [chuckles]

00:48:59.740 --> 00:49:03.077 line:80%
-[inhales deeply]
-But why did you suddenly get off earlier?

00:49:03.786 --> 00:49:05.704 line:80%
Oh. It was nothing.

00:49:05.788 --> 00:49:07.414 line:80%
There's a convenience store nearby.

00:49:07.498 --> 00:49:09.166 line:80%
I'll go buy some drinks for the nurses.

00:49:09.249 --> 00:49:10.751 line:80%
-[Manjae] Mmm.
-[plastic rustling]

00:49:11.710 --> 00:49:13.879 line:80%
Hmm? They didn't say it was going to rain.

00:49:14.338 --> 00:49:15.422 line:80%
Is it a shower?

00:49:15.506 --> 00:49:17.716 line:80%
I have a hood, so it's fine.
I'll be back soon.

00:49:17.800 --> 00:49:19.134 line:80%
[Manjae] Okay.

00:49:20.803 --> 00:49:22.846 line:80%
[♪ mysterious music playing]

00:49:24.723 --> 00:49:26.767 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>Who's that? Your friend?</i>

00:49:26.850 --> 00:49:28.519 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>No, just my roommate.</i>

00:49:31.981 --> 00:49:34.733 line:80%
Dr. Cha, we're starting rounds.

00:49:35.359 --> 00:49:36.360 line:80%
[Sujin] Okay.

00:49:39.530 --> 00:49:40.614 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Hospitalized?</i>

00:49:41.323 --> 00:49:43.450 line:80%
-Hyeokchan?
-[Eunchan] Don't you remember?

00:49:44.034 --> 00:49:46.453 line:80%
He hurt his hand badly in the lab.

00:49:46.537 --> 00:49:47.788 line:80%
He even got surgery.

00:49:48.747 --> 00:49:49.832 line:80%
A surgery?

00:49:50.624 --> 00:49:53.168 line:80%
I never heard anything about that.

00:49:53.252 --> 00:49:54.253 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:49:54.336 --> 00:49:56.171 line:80%
-[Nana exclaims excitedly]
-[Manjae chuckles]

00:49:56.255 --> 00:49:57.589 line:80%
Manjae, what do you think?

00:49:57.673 --> 00:50:00.592 line:80%
[exclaims] It looks like
Genius' paw print. It's cute.

00:50:00.676 --> 00:50:02.136 line:80%
-Right?
-Should I buy it for you?

00:50:02.219 --> 00:50:04.263 line:80%
-Sure.
-Okay. How much is it?

00:50:04.346 --> 00:50:05.639 line:80%
-Manjae!
-What? What is it?

00:50:05.723 --> 00:50:06.932 line:80%
<i>Tteokbokki! Tteokbokki!</i>

00:50:07.016 --> 00:50:09.143 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:50:11.520 --> 00:50:13.272 line:80%
[hums delightedly]

00:50:13.355 --> 00:50:15.190 line:80%
[chuckles] It's good.

00:50:15.816 --> 00:50:18.944 line:80%
Having <i>tteokbokki </i>after ditching
is the best.

00:50:19.028 --> 00:50:20.029 line:80%
Right?

00:50:20.112 --> 00:50:22.781 line:80%
That only applies
to the Chuncheon fashionista Nabong.

00:50:22.865 --> 00:50:24.992 line:80%
I never ditched school.

00:50:25.617 --> 00:50:28.329 line:80%
Ah. Right, of course.

00:50:28.412 --> 00:50:31.665 line:80%
You were the bookworm Park Manjae.

00:50:31.749 --> 00:50:33.417 line:80%
That's right.

00:50:33.500 --> 00:50:34.501 line:80%
[both laugh]

00:50:35.085 --> 00:50:36.128 line:80%
Excuse me.

00:50:36.670 --> 00:50:39.131 line:80%
Are you Kim Nana, by any chance?

00:50:39.214 --> 00:50:40.424 line:80%
It seems like it, right?

00:50:40.507 --> 00:50:42.343 line:80%
We're fashion design majors,

00:50:42.426 --> 00:50:44.678 line:80%
and we're huge fans.

00:50:44.762 --> 00:50:46.639 line:80%
Could I have an autograph?

00:50:46.722 --> 00:50:50.017 line:80%
Mmm… Oh, dear. My face is my autograph.

00:50:50.100 --> 00:50:52.394 line:80%
You can take a selfie with me.

00:50:52.478 --> 00:50:54.980 line:80%
-One, two, three.
-[camera clicks]

00:50:55.731 --> 00:50:57.858 line:80%
[student 1] Thank you.

00:50:57.941 --> 00:51:00.944 line:80%
By the way, your husband is freaking…

00:51:01.028 --> 00:51:02.863 line:80%
[student 2] I mean, he's really cool.

00:51:02.946 --> 00:51:04.865 line:80%
-No, I'm…
-He's freaking cool, isn't he?

00:51:05.491 --> 00:51:07.743 line:80%
I care about looks.

00:51:07.826 --> 00:51:09.953 line:80%
[students and Nana laugh]

00:51:13.582 --> 00:51:14.583 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:51:17.836 --> 00:51:20.130 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>Why do I feel so nervous</i>
<i>being alone with him?</i>

00:51:20.214 --> 00:51:21.965 line:80%
<i>Oh… I feel so hot.</i>

00:51:22.049 --> 00:51:25.094 line:80%
<i>Should I turn off the heater?</i>
<i>Would it show that I'm nervous?</i>

00:51:25.177 --> 00:51:27.429 line:80%
-[window whirring]
-[groans] It's hot.

00:51:27.513 --> 00:51:28.931 line:80%
[breathes deeply]

00:51:31.058 --> 00:51:32.351 line:80%
[coughing]

00:51:32.434 --> 00:51:33.769 line:80%
[sniffles, clears throat]

00:51:34.228 --> 00:51:35.312 line:80%
Should I close the window?

00:51:35.938 --> 00:51:37.773 line:80%
No, it's fine. You can do as you like.

00:51:40.526 --> 00:51:42.069 line:80%
[whirring]

00:51:47.116 --> 00:51:49.660 line:80%
Then would it be possible to get samples?

00:51:49.743 --> 00:51:53.080 line:80%
Yes, but it's over five times
the price of silk,

00:51:53.163 --> 00:51:55.082 line:80%
and the durability tests
aren't stable yet.

00:51:55.165 --> 00:51:57.376 line:80%
That's why I want to try this.

00:51:57.918 --> 00:51:59.086 line:80%
I want to make clothes

00:51:59.169 --> 00:52:01.338 line:80%
not just for display
but to prove the future.

00:52:01.797 --> 00:52:04.466 line:80%
I really want to achieve that
for our brand.

00:52:04.550 --> 00:52:06.343 line:80%
You seem very determined.

00:52:06.427 --> 00:52:08.679 line:80%
How should we get the samples?

00:52:08.762 --> 00:52:11.015 line:80%
There's a research facility
I came in touch with.

00:52:11.098 --> 00:52:13.726 line:80%
It's a bio startup company.
I'll give you their number.

00:52:14.268 --> 00:52:15.561 line:80%
-Really?
-[reporter] Yes.

00:52:16.061 --> 00:52:19.857 line:80%
And I'll ask them again
for their cooperation.

00:52:19.940 --> 00:52:21.817 line:80%
Thank you… [groans, chuckles excitedly]

00:52:21.900 --> 00:52:23.027 line:80%
I was just so grateful.

00:52:23.110 --> 00:52:25.446 line:80%
-Are you all right? [laughs]
-[Hayeong] Yes.

00:52:25.529 --> 00:52:27.448 line:80%
-You really mean it?
-Of course.

00:52:27.531 --> 00:52:29.533 line:80%
-Ms. Song, here's my business card.
-Ah.

00:52:29.616 --> 00:52:31.327 line:80%
Contact me if you have any questions.

00:52:31.410 --> 00:52:32.536 line:80%
Thank you.

00:52:32.619 --> 00:52:34.163 line:80%
It was nice seeing you again, Taeseok.

00:52:34.246 --> 00:52:37.166 line:80%
What? Do you two know each other?

00:52:37.249 --> 00:52:38.584 line:80%
Why didn't you tell me?

00:52:39.168 --> 00:52:42.171 line:80%
I'm actually his junior from college.

00:52:42.254 --> 00:52:43.380 line:80%
He asked me

00:52:43.464 --> 00:52:45.424 line:80%
to keep it a secret
in case you felt uneasy.

00:52:46.258 --> 00:52:49.303 line:80%
I tried to get close to him,
but he never let me back then.

00:52:49.762 --> 00:52:50.804 line:80%
And now--

00:52:50.888 --> 00:52:52.890 line:80%
Thank you for today, Mr. Chae.

00:52:52.973 --> 00:52:54.224 line:80%
I'll see you next time.

00:52:54.767 --> 00:52:55.976 line:80%
You haven't changed a bit.

00:52:57.978 --> 00:53:01.357 line:80%
I'd like to get to know you better.

00:53:01.440 --> 00:53:03.651 line:80%
How about a glass of wine together?

00:53:04.276 --> 00:53:05.653 line:80%
Just the two of us.

00:53:06.153 --> 00:53:09.365 line:80%
Just the two of us?

00:53:09.948 --> 00:53:10.949 line:80%
That's okay, right?

00:53:11.784 --> 00:53:13.952 line:80%
I don't think it's my place
to say yes or no.

00:53:14.870 --> 00:53:15.871 line:80%
Then excuse me.

00:53:18.749 --> 00:53:20.292 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>What was that?</i>

00:53:20.376 --> 00:53:22.419 line:80%
<i>Did he just set me up on a date?</i>

00:53:22.836 --> 00:53:24.421 line:80%
<i>Didn't he have feelings for me?</i>

00:53:25.714 --> 00:53:26.799 line:80%
Mr. Yeon.

00:53:27.341 --> 00:53:30.386 line:80%
Is it really okay for me
to have a drink with him, alone?

00:53:31.011 --> 00:53:32.930 line:80%
Why are you asking me that?

00:53:33.013 --> 00:53:34.974 line:80%
I think it's your business.

00:53:35.057 --> 00:53:36.392 line:80%
[♪ whimsical music playing]

00:53:36.475 --> 00:53:38.227 line:80%
Ah. Fine.

00:53:42.106 --> 00:53:44.733 line:80%
Mr. Chae, let's go have some wine.

00:53:44.817 --> 00:53:46.568 line:80%
I'm really craving a drink today.

00:53:51.865 --> 00:53:52.866 line:80%
[sighs]

00:53:54.326 --> 00:53:55.744 line:80%
-[sighs]
-[♪ music fades]

00:53:56.286 --> 00:53:58.539 line:80%
[Yougyum's mom] Hadam, enjoy these dishes.

00:53:58.622 --> 00:54:01.291 line:80%
You even packed side dishes for me?

00:54:01.375 --> 00:54:02.543 line:80%
Thank you.

00:54:02.626 --> 00:54:04.503 line:80%
Make sure to visit after the CSAT.

00:54:04.586 --> 00:54:06.046 line:80%
I promise I will.

00:54:07.089 --> 00:54:09.883 line:80%
But could you give me

00:54:11.385 --> 00:54:12.720 line:80%
one more hug?

00:54:12.803 --> 00:54:15.055 line:80%
Of course, I can. Come here.

00:54:15.139 --> 00:54:16.140 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:54:16.223 --> 00:54:17.683 line:80%
-[♪ amusing music playing]
-[Yougyum's mom exclaims]

00:54:17.766 --> 00:54:19.643 line:80%
I'll see you again later. Hmm?

00:54:19.727 --> 00:54:20.769 line:80%
Okay.

00:54:20.853 --> 00:54:23.314 line:80%
-Me too. I want a hug, too.
-My goodness!

00:54:23.397 --> 00:54:25.858 line:80%
[exclaims] Then I should join as well.

00:54:25.941 --> 00:54:29.028 line:80%
[all laughing]

00:54:30.529 --> 00:54:34.033 line:80%
[Haran] <i>A surgery?</i>
<i>I never heard anything about that.</i>

00:54:34.116 --> 00:54:35.576 line:80%
[Eunchan] <i>You didn't know?</i>

00:54:36.243 --> 00:54:39.538 line:80%
<i>I guess Chan didn't tell you</i>
<i>in case you got worried.</i>

00:54:44.126 --> 00:54:46.503 line:80%
[Chan clears throat] Excuse me.

00:54:46.587 --> 00:54:50.924 line:80%
You're Designer Song Haran
who won the Best Designer Award, right?

00:54:51.759 --> 00:54:53.927 line:80%
[chuckles] Oh? How are you here?

00:54:54.011 --> 00:54:56.930 line:80%
I have a habit of congratulating people
who receive awards.

00:54:57.806 --> 00:54:59.099 line:80%
Here.

00:54:59.600 --> 00:55:00.601 line:80%
Congratulations.

00:55:00.684 --> 00:55:02.394 line:80%
[♪ uplifting song playing]

00:55:03.228 --> 00:55:04.271 line:80%
Thanks.

00:55:05.356 --> 00:55:08.442 line:80%
[inhales sharply]
But why do you look so down

00:55:09.026 --> 00:55:10.402 line:80%
when you just won an award?

00:55:11.070 --> 00:55:13.072 line:80%
No, I'm really happy.

00:55:13.155 --> 00:55:15.282 line:80%
No, your expression looks…

00:55:16.784 --> 00:55:18.535 line:80%
-like this.
-[chuckles]

00:55:19.244 --> 00:55:21.664 line:80%
[chuckles softly] Let's go.

00:55:21.747 --> 00:55:22.915 line:80%
Go where?

00:55:23.707 --> 00:55:25.501 line:80%
Photos? That's so random.

00:55:26.335 --> 00:55:28.045 line:80%
I told you, what you took doesn't count.

00:55:28.128 --> 00:55:29.672 line:80%
Oh. This one's good.

00:55:29.755 --> 00:55:31.090 line:80%
All right. Come here.

00:55:34.802 --> 00:55:36.970 line:80%
Our Best Designer.

00:55:39.306 --> 00:55:41.725 line:80%
Okay. One, two, three.

00:55:44.228 --> 00:55:45.396 line:80%
You should smile.

00:55:46.230 --> 00:55:47.481 line:80%
This time with the flowers.

00:55:47.564 --> 00:55:48.565 line:80%
Here. Smile.

00:55:50.150 --> 00:55:52.194 line:80%
All right. One, two, three.

00:55:53.112 --> 00:55:55.906 line:80%
I'll do an ugly face for you
to make you look prettier.

00:55:55.990 --> 00:55:57.950 line:80%
One, two, three. [hums teasingly]

00:55:59.284 --> 00:56:00.369 line:80%
[Haran chuckles]

00:56:00.452 --> 00:56:01.453 line:80%
[Chan chuckles]

00:56:02.162 --> 00:56:03.872 line:80%
Pretty pose. [sneezes]

00:56:05.249 --> 00:56:07.292 line:80%
[Haran] Look at your expressions.
[giggles]

00:56:09.962 --> 00:56:11.880 line:80%
-Let's go to our next course.
-What?

00:56:11.964 --> 00:56:14.049 line:80%
Where? Where are we going?

00:56:15.509 --> 00:56:17.177 line:80%
Come on, let's go.

00:56:17.970 --> 00:56:18.971 line:80%
This way.

00:56:22.224 --> 00:56:25.352 line:80%
Wow. You came to such
a nice place alone? Tsk.

00:56:25.894 --> 00:56:27.980 line:80%
You're the one
who disappeared without telling me.

00:56:30.441 --> 00:56:32.735 line:80%
Excuse me, could you take a picture of us?

00:56:32.818 --> 00:56:34.570 line:80%
Sure, of course.

00:56:34.653 --> 00:56:36.530 line:80%
-Two, three.
-[camera clicks]

00:56:37.114 --> 00:56:39.074 line:80%
-Thank you.
-[Chan] Thank you.

00:56:39.158 --> 00:56:41.118 line:80%
Would you like a photo, too?

00:56:42.328 --> 00:56:43.579 line:80%
Sure.

00:56:43.662 --> 00:56:46.123 line:80%
Okay. Smile. [clears throat]

00:56:46.206 --> 00:56:48.167 line:80%
It'll look nice
if you smile at each other.

00:56:48.250 --> 00:56:50.294 line:80%
-Can you look at each other?
-Like this?

00:56:54.423 --> 00:56:56.008 line:80%
What should I do?

00:56:56.884 --> 00:56:59.219 line:80%
-[Chan] <i>I'll do an ugly face for you.</i>
-[chuckles]

00:56:59.303 --> 00:57:01.472 line:80%
-We'll take one for you, too.
-Oh, I'm okay.

00:57:06.727 --> 00:57:07.936 line:80%
[mouthing] Thank you.

00:57:10.522 --> 00:57:11.899 line:80%
[man] I'll take it now.

00:57:11.982 --> 00:57:13.901 line:80%
One, two, three.

00:57:18.364 --> 00:57:19.365 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

00:57:20.282 --> 00:57:23.535 line:80%
[Hadam] There's a blanket I've been using
since I was a baby,

00:57:24.453 --> 00:57:26.497 line:80%
and it had this distinctive scent.

00:57:28.332 --> 00:57:31.835 line:80%
It felt warm and comforting

00:57:33.587 --> 00:57:35.756 line:80%
and made me feel like I'm going to cry.

00:57:38.342 --> 00:57:40.469 line:80%
But that scent disappeared.

00:57:41.136 --> 00:57:43.347 line:80%
It smelled just like my mom used to.

00:57:45.224 --> 00:57:47.142 line:80%
But when your mom hugged me earlier,

00:57:49.561 --> 00:57:50.729 line:80%
I smelled the same scent.

00:57:50.813 --> 00:57:52.982 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:57:55.776 --> 00:57:56.777 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:57:58.070 --> 00:57:59.279 line:80%
So I ended up crying.

00:58:00.948 --> 00:58:03.033 line:80%
I thought it was the smell of detergent,

00:58:04.243 --> 00:58:05.911 line:80%
but I guess that was the scent of a mom.

00:58:08.747 --> 00:58:11.250 line:80%
Oh? Then wouldn't I smell similar?

00:58:12.543 --> 00:58:13.544 line:80%
Try smelling me.

00:58:15.504 --> 00:58:16.755 line:80%
[Hadam sniffs]

00:58:16.839 --> 00:58:18.966 line:80%
[both laugh]

00:58:19.049 --> 00:58:21.135 line:80%
You have a different scent.

00:58:22.886 --> 00:58:25.389 line:80%
I'm going to marry you, no matter what.

00:58:25.472 --> 00:58:26.515 line:80%
What?

00:58:26.598 --> 00:58:28.767 line:80%
[chuckles] Whenever I see you,

00:58:28.851 --> 00:58:31.812 line:80%
I wonder how you could be so wonderful.

00:58:31.895 --> 00:58:33.897 line:80%
But I understood when I saw your parents.

00:58:34.481 --> 00:58:36.775 line:80%
If they become my family,

00:58:37.359 --> 00:58:38.986 line:80%
I'll be so happy.

00:58:41.030 --> 00:58:42.823 line:80%
Still, I'll love you the most.

00:58:44.408 --> 00:58:45.451 line:80%
What do I do?

00:58:46.076 --> 00:58:49.538 line:80%
[sighs] I'm so happy,
I feel like I'm going to faint.

00:58:49.621 --> 00:58:52.833 line:80%
[chuckles] There's nothing left
but happiness for us.

00:58:52.916 --> 00:58:54.043 line:80%
Mm.

00:58:55.210 --> 00:58:57.421 line:80%
Let's go. I want to study.

00:58:57.504 --> 00:58:58.756 line:80%
Okay.

00:58:59.882 --> 00:59:01.216 line:80%
The minimum CSAT requirement?

00:59:01.925 --> 00:59:03.886 line:80%
It's going to be a piece of cake.

00:59:07.473 --> 00:59:08.766 line:80%
Why aren't you coming?

00:59:08.849 --> 00:59:10.476 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[Hadam giggles]

00:59:10.559 --> 00:59:12.186 line:80%
Did you really faint?

00:59:13.270 --> 00:59:15.731 line:80%
Come on. Stop fooling around.

00:59:17.399 --> 00:59:19.777 line:80%
[breath trembling] Hadam, what do I do?

00:59:22.988 --> 00:59:25.282 line:80%
I can't get up.

00:59:25.866 --> 00:59:26.867 line:80%
My foot…

00:59:26.950 --> 00:59:27.951 line:80%
What?

00:59:28.035 --> 00:59:30.037 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:59:32.373 --> 00:59:34.124 line:80%
-[winces]
-Huh?

00:59:41.757 --> 00:59:42.758 line:80%
[stutters] Yougyum…

00:59:42.841 --> 00:59:43.842 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:59:44.426 --> 00:59:45.928 line:80%
Thank you for the umbrella.

00:59:46.011 --> 00:59:47.137 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:59:48.931 --> 00:59:50.391 line:80%
See you.

00:59:51.100 --> 00:59:52.226 line:80%
-[in English] Yes!
-[in Korean] Bye.

00:59:52.309 --> 00:59:53.394 line:80%
Sure. Bye.

00:59:53.477 --> 00:59:54.687 line:80%
-Bye.
-Get home safely.

00:59:54.770 --> 00:59:55.771 line:80%
Okay.

00:59:57.314 --> 01:00:01.068 line:80%
Tsk. He made me
get my hopes up for nothing.

01:00:03.362 --> 01:00:05.614 line:80%
I should thank him.

01:00:06.198 --> 01:00:09.743 line:80%
I'm so grateful that he introduced us.

01:00:11.912 --> 01:00:13.914 line:80%
[line connects, rings]

01:00:14.790 --> 01:00:15.916 line:80%
Why isn't he picking up?

01:00:21.505 --> 01:00:25.676 line:80%
Mr. Yeon, I had so much fun
with Mr. Chae today…

01:00:27.344 --> 01:00:28.554 line:80%
What are you spying on?

01:00:28.637 --> 01:00:30.389 line:80%
Gosh, you scared me.

01:00:31.390 --> 01:00:34.393 line:80%
Did Mr. Yeon not come back here
after the meeting?

01:00:34.476 --> 01:00:36.270 line:80%
He just dropped by for a bit and left.

01:00:36.937 --> 01:00:37.938 line:80%
Ah.

01:00:38.022 --> 01:00:39.189 line:80%
You'd better buy me lunch…

01:00:39.648 --> 01:00:42.192 line:80%
[in singsong] for the information.

01:00:43.652 --> 01:00:45.821 line:80%
He always gets off work late, though.

01:00:45.904 --> 01:00:47.114 line:80%
[deliveryman] Mr. Yeon Taeseok?

01:00:48.324 --> 01:00:49.700 line:80%
There's a delivery for you.

01:00:50.367 --> 01:00:52.036 line:80%
I'll take that.

01:00:52.119 --> 01:00:53.662 line:80%
Thank you.

01:00:53.746 --> 01:00:55.831 line:20%
YEON TAESEOK

01:01:02.671 --> 01:01:04.340 line:80%
Mr. Yeon.

01:01:09.219 --> 01:01:11.305 line:80%
What? He's not home, either?

01:01:15.726 --> 01:01:17.561 line:80%
Mr. Yeon, I…

01:01:18.812 --> 01:01:19.813 line:80%
Oh?

01:01:19.897 --> 01:01:22.149 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

01:01:22.232 --> 01:01:23.442 line:80%
What…

01:01:23.525 --> 01:01:25.110 line:80%
-What's going on?
-[breath trembling]

01:01:27.154 --> 01:01:28.155 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:01:28.739 --> 01:01:32.576 line:80%
[exclaims delightedly]
This keychain is so cute. [chuckles]

01:01:33.077 --> 01:01:35.788 line:80%
Manjae, let's go have <i>sujebi </i>next time.

01:01:37.206 --> 01:01:40.250 line:80%
And let's visit Chuncheon as well
before it gets colder.

01:01:40.334 --> 01:01:41.794 line:80%
-Let's…
-Kim Nabong.

01:01:43.128 --> 01:01:44.171 line:80%
What?

01:01:44.254 --> 01:01:45.255 line:80%
Why aren't you coming?

01:01:46.590 --> 01:01:47.675 line:80%
You.

01:01:50.010 --> 01:01:51.387 line:80%
Where are you going this time?

01:01:52.012 --> 01:01:53.347 line:80%
I said let's go to Chuncheon.

01:01:53.430 --> 01:01:55.766 line:80%
You're behaving just like back then.

01:01:55.849 --> 01:01:58.644 line:80%
When you suddenly left for France
when you were 20,

01:01:58.727 --> 01:01:59.937 line:80%
you acted just like this.

01:02:00.020 --> 01:02:02.564 line:80%
You called me out of the blue

01:02:02.648 --> 01:02:05.025 line:80%
and said, "Let's do this. Let's go here."

01:02:05.776 --> 01:02:08.654 line:80%
Then you suddenly disappeared
without saying anything.

01:02:08.737 --> 01:02:10.781 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

01:02:11.740 --> 01:02:14.576 line:80%
That was a long time ago. Don't be silly.

01:02:14.660 --> 01:02:15.703 line:80%
Tell me.

01:02:16.537 --> 01:02:17.830 line:80%
What is it this time?

01:02:18.288 --> 01:02:20.040 line:80%
What on earth is going on with you?

01:02:24.545 --> 01:02:25.921 line:80%
[Haran chuckles softly]

01:02:27.506 --> 01:02:29.508 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

01:02:35.472 --> 01:02:36.598 line:80%
Hello?

01:02:38.309 --> 01:02:40.436 line:80%
Yes. May I ask who's calling?

01:02:49.445 --> 01:02:50.612 line:80%
Oh…

01:02:50.696 --> 01:02:51.947 line:80%
All right.

01:02:52.031 --> 01:02:53.532 line:80%
I'll go and check.

01:03:02.374 --> 01:03:03.375 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:03:03.459 --> 01:03:05.502 line:80%
[grunts, inhales sharply] Ah.

01:03:07.755 --> 01:03:08.881 line:80%
[hums]

01:03:11.550 --> 01:03:14.511 line:80%
[sighs] I miss you already.

01:03:15.512 --> 01:03:16.513 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

01:03:17.222 --> 01:03:19.099 line:80%
[cell phone buzzes, chimes]

01:03:19.183 --> 01:03:21.310 line:80%
-Hmm?
-[Haran] <i>Can you come out for a bit?</i>

01:03:27.650 --> 01:03:30.152 line:80%
[pants] That was fast, wasn't it?

01:03:30.653 --> 01:03:31.695 line:80%
Aren't you tired?

01:03:32.196 --> 01:03:34.657 line:80%
I mean, I told you to go home and rest,

01:03:34.740 --> 01:03:35.741 line:80%
but…

01:03:36.450 --> 01:03:40.621 line:80%
I was actually really sad
that you left. [chuckles]

01:03:40.704 --> 01:03:42.998 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

01:03:43.624 --> 01:03:44.625 line:80%
What is it?

01:03:45.292 --> 01:03:46.543 line:80%
Is something wrong?

01:03:47.378 --> 01:03:50.422 line:80%
I just got a call from the restaurant.

01:03:50.506 --> 01:03:51.965 line:80%
What restaurant?

01:03:57.680 --> 01:03:59.682 line:80%
[♪ music intensifies]

01:04:05.771 --> 01:04:08.774 line:80%
I think you owe me an explanation.

01:04:12.152 --> 01:04:14.405 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

01:04:30.587 --> 01:04:31.588 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:04:33.882 --> 01:04:35.843 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:04:35.926 --> 01:04:37.928 line:20%
[♪ emotional song playing]

01:04:59.950 --> 01:05:04.455 line:20%
[Haran] <i>It sounds like</i>
<i>they're not meant to be together.</i>

01:05:04.538 --> 01:05:08.042 line:20%
[Chan] <i>Can you tell me what you know</i>
<i>about what happened seven years ago?</i>

01:05:08.125 --> 01:05:10.294 line:20%
<i>I'll tell her everything</i>

01:05:10.377 --> 01:05:13.005 line:20%
<i>and apologize to her.</i>

01:05:13.088 --> 01:05:17.384 line:20%
[Taeseok] <i>The chance</i>
<i>of Ms. Song and I dating is zero.</i>

01:05:17.468 --> 01:05:22.097 line:20%
[Hayeong] <i>Am I really just mistaken</i>
<i>about all those situations?</i>

01:05:22.181 --> 01:05:24.683 line:20%
[Nana] <i>It's rare to find</i>
<i>someone who makes you smile.</i>

01:05:24.767 --> 01:05:26.727 line:20%
[Haran crying] <i>What if you're not okay?</i>

01:05:26.810 --> 01:05:28.354 line:20%
<i>What if something else happens?</i>

01:05:28.437 --> 01:05:30.939 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I want to stay by her side,</i>

01:05:31.023 --> 01:05:32.816 line:80%
<i>but I don't know what to do.</i>

01:05:36.195 --> 01:05:37.196 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:05:37.279 --> 01:05:39.281 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

01:05:45.162 --> 01:05:46.163 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:05:46.246 --> 01:05:47.247 line:80%
Translated by Juyoung Park